	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE:\nOne sensor for each rail is added to monitor current and voltage of the bucks' output.\nOne sensor is added for the input, it will help us deduce the motor power consumption.\nThey all run on the same SPI as 8 uS is a low enough update interval. The update interval is computed by this formula: \nNumber of devices * bit / sensor frequency = 8 uS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 185.42 36.83 0)
